1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,570
Add 1 to 100
in 3 seconds?

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:07,390
Challenge first! Add 1 through 10
in 8 seconds

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:12,390
One by one… that's busy!

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,160
The answer is 55!

5
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:17,330
What about up to 100? There's a trick

6
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,400
Pair the first and the last

7
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,370
1 + 10 = 11, 2 + 9 = 11…
All 11!

8
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:25,740
Five pairs of 11 → 55

9
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:28,010
Same thing up to 100

10
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,080
All 101, and 50 pairs!

11
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:33,650
101 × 50 = 5050, done in 3 seconds!

12
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,020
Make 1 through 10 into a staircase of dots

13
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,820
Flip the same staircase upside down
and put it on top?

14
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:40,190
10 wide, 11 tall —
a perfect rectangle!

15
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,760
One staircase is half of it

16
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:46,730
There's a story that the mathematician Gauss
solved it this way as a child

17
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:49,380
What is 1 through 20?

18
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:51,880
NEXT: The 9 times table
with 10 fingers!
